# symbolic SATO template
# family: Standard Retail (customer H/L/B/D/F) / 2x6
# ported field-for-field from c:\Workspace\southalr\dtlbl060r.i (85x/S86R right-hand branch).
#
# This size's side-panel behavior is genuinely different from every other Standard Retail
# size (see ApplyRetail2x6): the PEI/WA/COF/Tone/grade icon stack always shows regardless
# of PanelType, EXCEPT when CustomerChar="L" (Lowe's), which instead gets its own CPN box
# appended to the bottom of the label (folded into QtyWeightBlock — see ApplyRetail2x6).
# CustomerChar B/F additionally swap ColorDesc for CPN+ColorDesc with a highlight box
# (CustomerHighlightBlock). Also hardcodes prt-qty="01" like lt_retail_2x725.sato.

<STX>
\x1bA
\x1b%0
\x1bCS4
\x1b#E2
\x1bA3H000V0000
{SidePanelBlock}
\x1b%3
